00:00:01.991 --> 00:00:07.098
Here at Stanford, we are exceptionally
strong at teaching innovation and

00:00:07.098 --> 00:00:10.754
we are exceptionally strong
at teaching operators.

00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:16.444
So we now have a framework that
really feeds the mindset of the COO.

00:00:16.444 --> 00:00:21.321
